WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:48.020
You're wide open!

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:53.060
Watch this! Here's my final attack!

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:05.180
Ah Jie, why are you helping her?!

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:09.430
First off, I don't want to 
be a murderer for no reason.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.020
And secondly, can't you tell?

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:16.290
She's been holding back the whole time.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.140
She's not giving it her all.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.840
How'd you tell?

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.860
You idiot. Look behind you.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.180
Very good, Ah Jie.

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:36.890
You passed the test.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:42.850
Not her, though.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:52.080
Um, honestly, all that violence's so boring.

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:54.910
And look at the time! It's getting late.

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:56.350
Are you guys hungry?

00:02:58.130 --> 00:02:59.790
Ah Jie makes some mean ramen.

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:00.850
Wanna join us?

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:02.430
You've got to be kidding me!

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:06.270
Who're you to say when to 
fight and when to stop?!

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:08.290
Who do you think Missy here is?

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.860
You think she's a glutton like you idiots?!

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:34.090
Don't hold back. There's more.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:38.690
How is it? Do you like it?

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:46.000
This is amazing. It's delicious!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.120
Didn't I say so?

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.540
Here, drink up!

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:55.090
You gotta fight to get to know each other.

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:56.630
You'll have to forgive me for earlier.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.270
We didn't have a choice, you see.

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:01.020
Huh? Why's that?

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.250
You guys might not know this,

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.570
but there are both good and bad Summoners.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:07.900
There's always been different factions.

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:12.300
It's not uncommon to fight it out 
the moment you see each other.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:16.520
As for summoned spirits, there are 
both guardian and evil spirits.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.520
Missy and I are the city's guardians,

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:22.180
and we're glad to say 
you two passed our test.

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.970
You earned the right to join us.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:32.770
Hey, Missy, don't go! We 
haven't had dessert yet!

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.600
I knew it. Good grub alone 
can save this world.

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:50.440
Hana.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:55.020
Hana. That's my name.

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:58.520
Listen to me. I know you{your character} well,

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:01.180
but not your summoned spirit.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:07.160
I will keep watching you two.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.690
I won't take my eyes off you 24 hours a day.

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:16.140
What's going on? She's asking you out?!

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.820
Missy, wait up!

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:27.210
A confession...?

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:30.790
No... That's not what a black rose means.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:33.520
Its flower language means... you're 
a devil, and you belong to me.

00:05:57.010 --> 00:05:58.060
Brother!

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.600
Brother, come back!

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:18.430
Brother!

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:10.450
What's going on?!

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:25.770
Quiet! Don't panic!

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:32.020
Emergency! There is an accident on campus!

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.750
Everyone must evacuate immediately!

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.680
Evacuate immediately!

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:37.060
Dora, this way!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.430
I have to be dreaming still...

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:55.740
Sorry, coming through!

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:59.810
I hate fluffy, furry creatures!

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.080
Monkey army...

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:12.610
Attack!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:19.600
Locker Room

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.340
Alpaca army, attack!

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:37.890
Listen up! Evacuate to the gym, right now!

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:40.310
Hey, Dora. The gym's that way!

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:41.810
Where are you taking me?

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.930
You're a Summoner.

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:46.930
You gotta step up during times like this.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.870
Mamma mia!

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:55.910
Is this the... Animal kingdom...?

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:00.100
Breaking news! This just in!

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:03.140
All the animals in the 
downtown zoo have escaped!

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.790
Many have already flooded into the city.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:07.000
The city is in a level 1 state of emergency!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:10.100
Everyone is to head to the nearest 
evacuation center immediately!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.850
Do not panic, everyone. Right now—

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.520
Scream, run, and hide!

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:26.370
You stupid humans, tremble in fear 
before the power of us animals!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:29.140
This city is ours now!

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:31.030
Watch out!

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:47.780
That was close.

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.040
Hey, you, what are you spacing out for?

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.060
You'll get eaten!

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.220
Miaowu. What are you doing here?

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.220
It's dangerous here! Come, let's head home!

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.600
Miaowu, what's the matter?

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:21.520
Ah Jie, you dummy!

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.350
Do we know each other?

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.890
Ah Jie, be careful!

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:32.710
She's not a normal girl.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:39.680
Target sighted.

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:41.960
She summons animals, huh?

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:43.910
Quite an interesting foe we have this time.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.000
She's putting on a show, though.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.660
How is anyone supposed 
to deal with this mess?

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.520
Keep a low profile. Finish this quickly.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:52.540
Got it!

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.510
Smoke Fruit!

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:05.810
What's going on?

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.620
By the name of the Black Rose...

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:39.640
Stop it! Don't hurt them!

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:41.890
What a naughty stray kitten.

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:43.460
Did you know?

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:45.460
If you dare mess up Missy's turf,

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.210
you're gonna get your ass whooped. {spanked}

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:48.640
Shut up, you baddies!

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:51.500
Spill it. What are you after?

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:53.560
Why did you let all the 
animals out of their cages?

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:56.500
We animals have always been here.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.090
That's how it's always been,

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:00.100
but you humans came and took all the land.

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:04.180
You shameless people are the ones 
who should be locked in cages!

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:06.560
Whoa, that's intense.

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:10.470
Enough chit-chat! I'll give you ten 
seconds to hand your spirit over!

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:13.350
Zip it! I'll give you one 
second to let my buddies go!

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:47.730
Look at them fight.

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:50.930
Whose side are we on?

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.680
Slow down. Let's see how it turns out.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:59.060
So fast.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:04.420
By the name of the Black Rose...

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:39.410
Damn it, you plant freak!

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:41.930
I'm seriously pissed now!

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.850
The eyes of eagles!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.600
The speed of leopards!

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:11.300
The might of bears!

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:22.970
Nice! Amazing!

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:26.330
Maybe she's got "the memory of 
fish, the brains of pigs" too?

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:30.890
Those moves' names remind 
me of some old cartoon...

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:51.980
Missy, we can't hold it much 
longer. Let's finish this.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.430
By the name of the Black Rose...

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:05.180
Big guy, finish her!

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:32.560
They're pretty evenly matched.

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:36.210
No, given the situation, Hana's 
got the advantage here.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:45.640
Fortify!

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:07.020
It's time to finish this fight!

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:14.040
Hug! Squeeze! Kill!

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.790
Overwhelming advantage!

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.800
Bet five bucks Hana's gonna win!

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:25.890
Not necessarily.

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:41.180
Round 2...

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:43.310
starts now!

00:16:56.380 --> 00:16:58.040
Missy!

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:59.720
Fortify the tree titan.

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.220
Piercing form!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:11.300
Come, let's have a dance together.

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.720
An elegant ballet!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:23.570
This is getting a bit fierce, isn't it?

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:27.400
Is it all over?

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.770
What? You don't know when to stop, do you?!

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.250
They'll both die if they carry on like this.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.180
Not good!

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:33.960
Dora, do you have any non-lethal weapons?

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:34.770
The best you got!

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:36.600
Let me check.

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:42.220
There's no time!

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:48.480
Soul Shackles!

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:00.020
Enough, you two!

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:06.620
You don't see eye to eye,

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.870
but can't you sit down and talk 
about your dreams and life instead?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.370
Ah Jie, you bastard, stop butting in!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.620
Let go of me!

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:27.060
It's not over yet!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.410
There's no need to keep 
this pointless fight up.

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:37.830
I found the Summoner already.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:39.880
Isn't that right, Miaowu?

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:41.640
What?

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:47.150
I knew you'd find out, Ah Jie.

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:53.850
Huh? Hold up! I don't get it!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.660
You mean, it's that kitten?!

00:19:56.660 --> 00:20:00.180
That's right. The girl just now 
was merely a summoned spirit,

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.680
and this cat is the Summoner.

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:09.230
You people always jump 
straight to the fighting,

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:11.850
and always overlook what's obvious.

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:15.290
I don't know why Miaowu made such a mess,

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:17.810
but I'm sure she has her reasons.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.120
Ah Jie, I...

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:22.690
Say no more. Let's take 
care of your wounds first.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:34.960
It's just like... when we... first met.

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.510
A stray cat?

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:57.750
How'd you get this hurt?

00:20:58.500 --> 00:20:59.950
Your wounds are infected.

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:09.220
Alright, don't be afraid.

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:11.620
I'll be done soon.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:23.500
Well, aren't you lively. Looks 
like you're gonna be fine.

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:29.810
Don't worry. It'll all get better.

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:36.870
Right, what's your name?

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.620
Alright, I'll call you Miaowu, then.

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:48.660
Alright.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.600
It's very simple.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.790
Ah Jie's subdued the Summoner.

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:55.050
That's the danger dealt 
with. We're done here.

00:21:55.050 --> 00:21:55.820
Huh?

00:21:57.660 --> 00:21:59.040
Not so fast!

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:02.270
Hand the cat over, and only then is it over!

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:20.130
<i>Sit with you watching the night sky</i>

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:25.370
<i>Vast stars reflect in our eyes</i>

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:32.960
<i>Like thousands of tiny wishes in our hearts</i>

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:38.480
<i>Longing to discover the origin of the 
mysterious everlasting ancient world</i>

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:43.470
<i>The past and the present are 
linked in a fantastic instant</i>

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:48.470
<i>Watch over our beautiful 
home against evil forever</i>

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:53.460
<i>The blazing sun is our inevitable 
cruel test of growth</i>

00:22:53.460 --> 00:22:58.510
<i>May we return from thorny 
paths still being young</i>

00:22:58.510 --> 00:23:03.510
<i>With love and hate, laughter and 
tears, compose every touching moment</i>

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:08.470
<i>Five friends shoulder to shoulder, 
friendship will last until eternity</i>

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:15.920
<i>With you tomorrow must 
be full of shining hopes</i>

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:21.070
<i>Our tomorrow</i>
